    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/c0d8ab49e53442d81337ed26211e53b4.avif?t=1753694762\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/1d62794842d123c836d9e8a54c62f546.poster.avif?t=1753694762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/1d62794842d123c836d9e8a54c62f546.webm?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/1d62794842d123c836d9e8a54c62f546.mp4?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/e7666ac51de3f008e1b8510403ae40fa.avif?t=1753694762\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and care for your own unique ecosystem, populated by bunnies, foxes, and more. Keeping your animals happy earns you valuable Leaf Points. Watch your bunnies grow and earn more rewards over time! Use Leaf Points to purchase new animals and gain upgrades, such as increasing the quality and amount of food you generate in your ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/bf4700f860fe86c875aa4dfe28a5fbca.poster.avif?t=1753694762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/bf4700f860fe86c875aa4dfe28a5fbca.webm?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/bf4700f860fe86c875aa4dfe28a5fbca.mp4?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/2d5719f9844925a0212a3b5f222c2b7f.avif?t=1753694762\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance levels by unlocking special chests using Leaf Points. Each chest contains a unique companion with special abilities to help you maintain the ecosystem. You can bring up to three companions per level to increase your efficiency. For example, Daisy can breed bunnies, while Ferdinand will lay eggs, which will bring you a large number of Leaf Points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/dccbd3fa37c7f06f7681aa7a1fccdae1.poster.avif?t=1753694762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/dccbd3fa37c7f06f7681aa7a1fccdae1.webm?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/dccbd3fa37c7f06f7681aa7a1fccdae1.mp4?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/fb5da40c6e497eed92e786e9f36fad53.avif?t=1753694762\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your ecosystem from invading monsters that emerge from portals. Each enemy presents a unique challenge, from single-target Swamp Golems to powerful Granite Guardians with long-range laser attacks. Defeating these threats quickly will earn you valuable rewards and allow you to upgrade your weapons to take on stronger foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/7b7b6830b68d9a3036c8b91b5e5f0e0f.poster.avif?t=1753694762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/7b7b6830b68d9a3036c8b91b5e5f0e0f.webm?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/7b7b6830b68d9a3036c8b91b5e5f0e0f.mp4?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Equiverse and enjoy the fun and excitement of creating, nurturing and defending your own ecosystem!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/c0d8ab49e53442d81337ed26211e53b4.avif?t=1753694762\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/1d62794842d123c836d9e8a54c62f546.poster.avif?t=1753694762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/1d62794842d123c836d9e8a54c62f546.webm?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/1d62794842d123c836d9e8a54c62f546.mp4?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/e7666ac51de3f008e1b8510403ae40fa.avif?t=1753694762\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and care for your own unique ecosystem, populated by bunnies, foxes, and more. Keeping your animals happy earns you valuable Leaf Points. Watch your bunnies grow and earn more rewards over time! Use Leaf Points to purchase new animals and gain upgrades, such as increasing the quality and amount of food you generate in your ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/bf4700f860fe86c875aa4dfe28a5fbca.poster.avif?t=1753694762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/bf4700f860fe86c875aa4dfe28a5fbca.webm?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/bf4700f860fe86c875aa4dfe28a5fbca.mp4?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/2d5719f9844925a0212a3b5f222c2b7f.avif?t=1753694762\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance levels by unlocking special chests using Leaf Points. Each chest contains a unique companion with special abilities to help you maintain the ecosystem. You can bring up to three companions per level to increase your efficiency. For example, Daisy can breed bunnies, while Ferdinand will lay eggs, which will bring you a large number of Leaf Points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/dccbd3fa37c7f06f7681aa7a1fccdae1.poster.avif?t=1753694762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/dccbd3fa37c7f06f7681aa7a1fccdae1.webm?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/dccbd3fa37c7f06f7681aa7a1fccdae1.mp4?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/fb5da40c6e497eed92e786e9f36fad53.avif?t=1753694762\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your ecosystem from invading monsters that emerge from portals. Each enemy presents a unique challenge, from single-target Swamp Golems to powerful Granite Guardians with long-range laser attacks. Defeating these threats quickly will earn you valuable rewards and allow you to upgrade your weapons to take on stronger foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/7b7b6830b68d9a3036c8b91b5e5f0e0f.poster.avif?t=1753694762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/7b7b6830b68d9a3036c8b91b5e5f0e0f.webm?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950400/extras/7b7b6830b68d9a3036c8b91b5e5f0e0f.mp4?t=1753694762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Equiverse and enjoy the fun and excitement of creating, nurturing and defending your own ecosystem!</p>",
    "short_description": "Experience the ultimate ecosystem simulator! Equiverse is an action-packed simulation game where you take care of different species of animals, earn income by keeping them happy, unlock helpful companions, and fend off invading monsters. Can you keep your ecosystem thriving?",
